      "NO_SCEN": "S222SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S222EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Desburg Survivor \n\u0022Unholy Dagger! Anabaziz and his men are fools. By unleashing what they cannot understand, they have cursed us all! The Unholy Dagger\u0027s curse is to transform all that once were alive into shells. Soulless  shells to roam the land!\u0022 ",
